      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slatington%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Fireman's Drinking Fountain and the surrounding historic district earned National Register of Historic Places status in 2010.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
