      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slatington%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Slatington sits on the west bank of the Lehigh River, 14 miles northwest of Allentown, with elevations ranging from 345 to 742 feet.",
